        "description": "Market Research & Trading Operations Internship (Paid)\nHo Chi Minh City (Hybrid / Private Office in Thảo Điền)\nOverview\nWe are building a small, focused team of interns in Ho Chi Minh City to support a U.S. stock market research and trading operations division.\nThis is a unique opportunity to work directly under an American entrepreneur and active U.S. stock market trader in a fast-paced, team-based environment.\nSelected interns will become part of a focused “trading pod” responsible for monitoring live market activity, tracking key data, and supporting research and operational systems.\nThis is an exciting moment to enter the market.\nWith potential U.S. regulatory changes expected in the coming weeks/months (including potential changes to PDT rules), market conditions may create major new opportunities for active traders and research teams.\nWe are building now.\nInterns will gain real-world exposure to:\n* live market monitoring\n* pattern recognition\n* data analysis\n* market research\n* operational systems\n* process development\nWe have access to top trading platforms, advanced market tools, professional hardware, and a private office environment in Thảo Điền.\nThis role is ideal for intelligent, disciplined, competitive, and fast-learning individuals who want to immerse themselves in a high-performance environment and get as much as possible from the opportunity.\nNo prior trading experience is required.\nResponsibilities\nAs part of the trading operations pod, interns may be responsible for:\n* Monitoring stock scanners, Level 2, Time & Sales, charts, and Bookmap\n* Tracking news catalysts and unusual market activity\n* Communicating important market developments in real time\n* Logging trade setups, metrics, and data into spreadsheets\n* Recording and organizing market sessions using Loom\n* Capturing screenshots and historical examples\n* Assisting with backtesting and statistical analysis\n* Organizing digital archives and files\n* Supporting SOP and workflow development\nSchedule\nFlexible scheduling depending on the right candidate(s).\nThe most active market research and monitoring window is during the U.S. premarket and market open, approximately:\n6:00 AM EST – 9:30 AM EST (5:00 PM – 8:30 PM Vietnam time, depending on daylight savings)\nTeam members who are “all in” and committed to being present during the most important market hours will get the most out of this opportunity.\nAdditional time may be spent in the office collaborating, reviewing trades, studying setups, and building systems together.\nThis is more than a traditional internship—it is an opportunity to join an ambitious, focused team environment.\nCompensation\nPaid internship:\n5,000,000 – 10,000,000 VND/month\nbased on schedule, experience, and performance.\nPerformance bonuses available.\nTop-performing interns may be offered long-term full-time positions.",
